Package: metricengineR
Title: Reusable Functions for Metric Engine Pipelines
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Siti", "Hassan", , "siti.hassan@nhs.net", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides reusable functions for metric engine workflows,
    including database extraction and loading, indicator processing, data
    standardisation, calculation helpers, output tidying, and supporting
    transformations used across analytical frameworks such as oversight,
    outcomes, and health inequalities reporting.
